# Code owners for et-dagen.
#
# Only the workflows are owned. The `dev` ruleset requires code owner review, so
# a pull request into `dev` that changes `.github/workflows/` needs an approval
# from @et-dagen/managers. Every other pull request needs one approval from any
# member with write access.
#
# This protects releases. The "Promote to production" workflow runs from `dev`
# and receives the production deploy key once a manager approves a release.
# Without this rule, a changed workflow could be merged with an ordinary
# approval and read the key on the next approved release.

/.github/workflows/ @et-dagen/managers
